WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.443 --> 00:00:03.589
Unit twenty-four. Tell a Grown-up!

2
00:00:04.522 --> 00:00:09.734
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.784 --> 00:00:13.335
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.385 --> 00:00:17.455
Today we learn about Tell a Grown-up. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:22.667
Scary. Say it with me. Scary!

6
00:00:26.213 --> 00:00:29.869
Sad. Say it with me. Sad!

7
00:00:33.338 --> 00:00:37.538
Online. Say it with me. Online!

8
00:00:41.028 --> 00:00:44.394
Tell. Say it with me. Tell!

9
00:00:47.852 --> 00:00:52.319
Trusted adult. Say it with me. Trusted adult!

10
00:00:55.845 --> 00:00:59.409
Close. Say it with me. Close!

11
00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:06.857
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

12
00:01:10.405 --> 00:01:14.222
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

13
00:01:17.648 --> 00:01:29.308
Sometimes I might see something online that is scary or makes me feel sad. I close the screen and tell a trusted adult right away. They will help me stay safe.

14
00:01:29.358 --> 00:01:32.698
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:33.442 --> 00:01:38.851
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:38.901 --> 00:01:40.051
Online!

17
00:01:41.238 --> 00:01:46.844
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.894 --> 00:01:48.044
Screen!

19
00:01:49.059 --> 00:01:55.929
Did you know? You will never be in trouble for telling a trusted adult about something that upset you online!

20
00:01:55.979 --> 00:01:58.149
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:07.541
Think and answer. Who is a trusted adult you can tell?

22
00:02:07.591 --> 00:02:08.787
Great answer!

23
00:02:09.822 --> 00:02:15.209
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:15.259 --> 00:02:18.864
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

